  "description": "Fuselage: Crimson, with a white stripe from the fin's root down and forward to the belly, gray behind it over the tail cone. Cheatlines: None. Tail: Gray with a crimson leading edge edged in white, WSU's white Cougar head. Engines: Crimson. Winglets: Gray, the Cougar head small. Titles: White 'Alaska' with 'HORIZON' after it under the forward windows; 'GO COUGS' very big in white across the windows; 'WASHINGTON STATE UNIVERSITY' small behind the wing. Colors hex: WSU crimson and gray are the university's; the paint matched by eye.",
